 "descriptionHtml": "<p>A ring with something to say when you move. A chunky polished dome band wrapped by two slim pavé collars, with a short swag of chain between them and a single pear cut stone hanging from it. Quiet when still, a small swing of light when the hand moves.</p><p><strong>STYLING TIP:</strong> Wear it on the middle finger so the drop swings when you move.</p><p><strong>Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Band: Polished dome, approximately 6mm wide</li>\n<li>Detail: Two slim pavé collars with a short chain swag between them</li>\n<li>Drop: One pear cut clear cubic zirconia, approximately 7mm</li>\n<li>Sizes: US 6, 7 and 8</li>\n<li>Plating: 18k gold tone plated or rhodium plated silver tone (choose above)</li>\n<li>Material: Surgical stainless steel</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Waterproof and tarnish free, so daily wear and water are fine. Keep it away from perfume and harsh chemicals, wipe with a soft dry cloth and store it flat in its pouch.</p><p>You will receive your piece in a Naira Petite box.</p>",
